                <p><span data-field="product_description_1">{{ product_description_1 }}</span> is a fully owned subsidiary of <span data-field="subsidiary_name">{{ subsidiary_name }}</span> Co., Ltd. and is one of the leading manufacturers of mobile display and related products globally. It also deals with sales, R&D, and manufacturing of low-temperature-ature polyolefin, thin-film transistor liquid crystal display and amorphous silicon. Its products are renowned for the affinity to touch screen function.</p>
