    <div class="body-text">
        <p>When thunderstorms and temporarily were stopping their production lines to avoid the effect of voltage sags. However, this practice meant there was a potential of increased electricity costs with the use of the power supply. The solution was to mitigate voltage sags by implementing ABB's technology.</p>
        <p>The solution chosen for this project was two 480 V AVCs protecting down to 40% sags and one UPS battery system rated to supply 500 kVA at 208 V/3 phase for five minutes.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 30px;">
