        <div style="width: 30%; text-align: center;">
            <p>Power supply after PCS100 UPS-I</p>
            <img src="placeholder_diagram_5.png" alt="Power Supply Diagram 3" style="max-width: 90%;">
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="body-text" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <p>The UPS-I is a new generation line interactive power protection solution. It protects customer's loads through outages caused by fluctuations in the electricity network and weather events such as lightning. It is a particu-larly good solution for recorder events, deep voltage sags (drops) or swells and voltage fluctuations. It is a high-performance UPS that is dependent on the power require-ment of the load in kW and the capacity of the UPS system. The PCS100 UPS-I is a battery free solution, which poses one of its advantages, along with sag and swell protection and continuous voltage protection. The PCS100 UPS-I is 1+1 topology, which demands only a small footprint, and its applications such as motors, drives, transformers and tools. It also provides pro-tection during deep sag and swell, plus outages between seconds and minutes depending on storage (super capacitors or batteries) and system loading.</p>
    </div>
</div>

